;
; How Tintype files an album in its tree, in MYRA (tintype_rules.h TR6):
; under its parent album (0 the root), its own number, then the bytes the
; owner declared for it, the bytes it holds and how many photos it holds.
^ZXTINTYPE(parent:i4, album:i4) = declared:i15! ^ used:i15! ^ photos:i5!
